# CODEOWNERS
#
# This repository is a fork of patrickchugh/terravision, and it is a production
# dependency: `cxmlabs/koomo` pins it by commit SHA in
# src/cxm-memories/repo_graph/pyproject.toml. A change landing on main can reach
# the application as soon as that pin moves.
#
# A git dependency is fetched by commit SHA and never passes through the PyPI
# index, so it is NOT covered by the 7-day package quarantine koomo applies to
# indexed packages (`exclude-newer`, CLO-4256). Review here is the compensating
# control.
#
# Available GitHub teams:
#   @cxmlabs/engineering      — all engineers
#   @cxmlabs/sre              — SRE
#
# Rules are matched bottom-up — the last matching rule wins.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Default — all engineers
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                    @cxmlabs/engineering

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Packaging and CI — SRE. These decide what actually ships.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
pyproject.toml       @cxmlabs/sre
poetry.lock          @cxmlabs/sre
requirements.txt     @cxmlabs/sre
.github/             @cxmlabs/sre
